OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThe morning will be cloudy with
OL,6,Fpatchy light rain or drizzle in the
OL,7,Fsouth but dry with clear periods in
OL,8,Fthe north. The rain will clear by the
OL,9,Fearly afternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FThe evening will start dry
OL,12,Fwith clear periods. Cloud and patchy
OL,13,Flight rain or drizzle spread across
OL,14,Fthe east from late evening.
OL,15,
OL,16,CMonday:FCloudy with light rain and
OL,17,Fdrizzle at first. Outbreaks of
OL,18,Fpersistent and at times heavy rain
OL,19,Fwill spread east from mid-morning.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
